ertising</li>\n+112                 <li>Right to opt out of affiliate tracking</li>\n+113             </ul>\n+114 \n+115             <h2 className=\"scroll-m-20 border-b pb-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10\">\n+116                 8. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)\n+117             </h2>\n+118             <p className=\"leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">\n+119                 If you are a California resident, you have the right to know what personal information we collect, the right to request deletion, and the right to opt out of the sale of your personal information. Note that we do not sell your personal information to third parties.\n+120             </p>\n+121 \n+122             <h2 className=\"scroll-m-20 border-b pb-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10\">\n+123                 9. General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)\n+124             </h2>\n+125             <p className=\"leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">\n+126                 For users in the European Economic Area, we process your personal data based on legitimate interest, consent, or contractual necessity. You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, and port your data.\n+127             </p>\n+128 \n+129             <p className=\"leading-7 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\">\n  82                 The security of your data is important to us, but remember that no method of transmission over the Internet, or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your Personal Data, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.\n  83             </p>\n  84         </div>\n  85       </div>\n     ...","firstChangedLine":75},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770970102782}}
